&lt;h1 id="-log">📃 Log&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#-log" aria-label="Heading self-link">&lt;/a>&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>We can use logs to observe program behavior, diagnose problems, or configure corresponding alarms. And defining a well structured log can improve search efficiency and facilitate handling of problems.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	我们可以使用日志来观察程序行为、诊断问题或配置相应的告警。并且定义一个结构良好的日志可以提高搜索效率，方便问题的处理。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>